     "text": "Interior design project for a private house in Dunajská Streda, Slovakia, 140 m²"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "parts": [
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "<strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN (Bratislava, Slovakia)</strong> developed an interior design project for a 140 m² private house in Dunajská Streda, Slovakia, taking into account the architecture of the house and the owners’ everyday needs."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "All rooms in the house share a common style: materials, textures, colors, furniture, and lighting were selected as a single composition."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The project included the interior concept and the solutions for implementing it; renovation work and furniture manufacturing for this property were not carried out by <strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN</strong>."
      }
     ]
    },
